# The build context must never carry the corpus. data/ is tens of GB of
# gitignored substrate, ledgers and attempt logs; it is MOUNTED at runtime,
# never baked. Everything here is excluded first and re-included explicitly.
*

# The package and its entry points.
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!scripts/

# Tests enter the build context for the `test` STAGE, which runs them with
# neither gilda nor indra installed and fails the build if they are red. They
# are NOT copied into the runtime image, and pytest is not installed there.
!tests/

# Re-exclusions inside the allow-list above.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

# Never, under any circumstance.
.venv/
.env
data/
viewer/
research/
.git/
.claude/
